{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b5b9f71db133664d","name":"Halcyon/Horn Legacy","source":{"id":"source:reference-b5b9f71db133664d","title":"Halcyon/Horn Legacy","revision":20185,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:22:22Z","sha256":"3b01a9045ef5dabf26ce379ae6a40f563fbc60bbae6171bdf21a8bd6073c2774","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20185","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Halcyon/Horn%20Legacy&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b5b9f71db133664d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a descendant of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Corran Horn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Corran_Horn","referenceId":"reference:16d2b573777d20a1"},", a Corellian police officer-turned-Jedi, as well as the famous Jedi ",{"tag":"a","children":["Keiran Halcyon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Keiran_Halcyon?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Your family is known for its skill with [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] Force Powers as well as its investigative skills, not to mention its long-standing association with the Fringe thanks to your ancestor ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mirax Terrik"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mirax_Terrik"},". Your family is also a Corellian family that holds many of the Corellian Jedi traditions.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Halcyon bloodline illustrates one of the unique ways that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," can manifest itself within a family. Members of the Halcyon bloodline have great difficulty manifesting Telekinetic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"},". Characters of this Legacy should rarely choose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Telekinetic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telekinetic"}]},"] descriptor, or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talents"}," that enhance such powers. To make up for this deficiency, members of the Halcyon bloodline gravitate toward ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Mind-Affecting"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mind-Affecting"}]},"] descriptor and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talents"}," that create ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Illusions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illusions"}]},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Near-Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Near-Human","referenceId":"reference:9e3b9745aa61a48a"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Legacy Destiny:"]}," If you have ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Destiny"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," to automatically treat any skill check made to activate a Mind-Affecting effect as though you had rolled a 20 on the check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
